## API reference

| Part | Props | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| `TooltipProvider` | `delay:` (200), `close_delay:` (0), `timeout:` (400) | Shared timing for the tooltips inside. |
| `Tooltip` | `delay:` / `close_delay:` (override), `track_cursor_axis:` (`:x`, `:y`, `:both`), `disabled:`, `default_open:` | One tooltip. |
| `TooltipTrigger` | block `{ \|trigger\| … }` | The described element (a `<span>` without a block argument). |
| `TooltipContent` | `side:` (`:top`), `align:`, `side_offset:` (8), `align_offset:`, `arrow:` | The bubble (`role="tooltip"`). |
